<title>USA: Outdoor Systems sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Outdoor Systems sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Outdoor Systems Inc said on Thursday it has set a three-for-two stock split in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>It is to be payable on July 3 to holders of record on June 23.</p>
<p>Outdoor Systems is an out-of-home media company, operating poster, bulletin, transit shelter and subway displays.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
